            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us</th></tr><tr><td>The patient’s HIV-1 RNA viral load is detectable at 47,192 copies/mL, which is within the quantifiable range of the assay but indicates active viral replication. This suggests either untreated HIV infection or possible treatment failure. Clinical correlation and further evaluation of antiretroviral therapy status and immune function (e.g., CD4 count) are recommended.</td></tr></table></div>"
